00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:59.610
It is, however, part
of my desire and effort

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.410
to bring zero-cost-to-consumer information

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.390
about science and science-related tools

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:04.740
to the general public.

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:05.790
In keeping with that theme,

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.520
